 (1976). She married Hamel in 1977. She was fired from the series after she asked for a raise at the beginning of the fifth season ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2023&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2003, Mulroney played Gavin Mitchell on the TV series Friends. He appeared in three episodes of the ninth season, his character briefly dating Rachel. This would mark Mulroney's last on-screen appearance on television for a number of years, later revealing in a May 2007 interview ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d40\"},\"ref\":\"d40\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was married to Star Herrmann and Leigh Curran. He died on 31 December 2014 in New York City, New York, USA.- Actor\\n\\n- Producer\\n\\n- Additional Crew\\n\\nOne of Hollywood's finest character / \\\"Method\\\" actors, Eli Wallach was in demand for over 60 years (first film/TV role was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d41\"},\"ref\":\"d41\",\"snippet\":\" ... for his Frank Barrone character without a win, the only prime player on the show unhonored. He survived a heart attack while on the set of \\\"Everybody Loves Raymond\\\" in 1999, but managed to return full time for the remainder of the series' run through 2005.\\n\\nFollowing a ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1935&ref_=nmbio\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"ececa93982d5cc3c8b1ec634b6a974515b4574ba180d31cc8fc222e8f4528376\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"a7c3a13ec463b78506b45cb0a90d55b90bf8ba53e1749256019bcdeac9de6cdd\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"character married four times one surviving child TV series\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... occasionally like to cast actors who are actually related to one another in real life, or are married and have decided to form a new family with one another.\\n\\nWhether these two relatives show up on the same show or not depends on the specifics of the situation ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d43\"},\"ref\":\"d43\",\"snippet\":\" ... No, television has been on a steady climb since the Golden Age, which critics estimate started around 10 years ago. Therefore, IndieWire's team of TV experts deemed it necessary to celebrate some of the best TV shows of the past decade.\\n\\nWith so many TV shows on ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.indiewire.com/feature/best-tv-shows-decade-2010-2019-netflix-hbo-1202148573/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... real-life drinking problem; he admitted he had been an alcoholic for 25 years. That same year he guest-starred as a murderous photographer on an episode of Columbo, Negative Reaction. Van Dyke returned to comedy in 1976 with the sketch comedy show Van Dyke and Company, on ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dick_Van_Dyke\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d44\"},\"ref\":\"d44\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Brady Bunch - What man with a quirky delivery, who later played the mayor on \\\"Family Guy\\\", portrayed Batman on the relatively silly TV show that aired from 1966-1968?\\n\\nAnswer: Adam West - William Hartnell, Patrick Troughton, and Tom Baker were amongst the earliest people to portray what ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watercoolertrivia.com/trivia-questions/classic-tv-trivia-questions\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d45\"},\"ref\":\"d45\",\"snippet\":\" ... Not to be confused with Real-Life Relative, which is when the actors actually are related, either by blood or marriage, not necessarily playing relatives, and don't even have to look alike (as family members often don't).\\n\\nExamples:\\n\\n- In the Kia commercials with Blake Griffin time ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeparatedAtBirthCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d46\"},\"ref\":\"d46\",\"snippet\":\" ... clocks and watches clipped from TV shows and movies, which has been shown at LACMA, is synced to the real time in which it's shown. In the theater, we find the Royal Shakespeare Company's eight-hour production of \\\"The Life and Adventures of Nicholas Nickleby\\\" — saw ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/tv/story/2024-09-05/television-series-art-length-time\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d47\"},\"ref\":\"d47\",\"snippet\":\" ... The adaptation changes a character's ethnicity.\\n\\n- Real-Life Relative: Related characters are played by actors who actually are related in real life.\\n\\n- Real Life Writes the Hairstyle: A character's hairstyle is affected by real-life circumstances.\\n\\n- Real-Person Cameo: A work with a character based on ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CharactersAndCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d48\"},\"ref\":\"d48\",\"snippet\":\" ... relationships on-screen.\\n\\nPlaying more than one role is a challenge for actors, especially when done simultaneously. But when done right, it can have a marvelous effect. It is not uncommon for actors to play more than one character in a TV show or movie, with scenarios including ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/actors-multiple-characters-same-tv-show/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d49\"},\"ref\":\"d49\",\"snippet\":\" ... plays Maria Callas' protective butler in Pablo Larraín's \\\"Maria,\\\" doesn't back down from a fight, on-screen or in life.\\n\\nAt last year's Venice Film Festival, the Rome native erupted with the kind of volcanic indignation that Callas was known for, furious that American actors ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3758542/news/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d50\"},\"ref\":\"d50\",\"snippet\":\" ... Doyle might have been a little less pleased with the liberties taken with the plot. But still it was done on a relatively intelligent level.\\n\\nBob Hoskins takes a turn playing Challenger, a scientist with the reputation for being a crackpot. He outdoes himself when he claims that ... \",\"title\":\"http://leepers.us/6_Lost_Worlds.htm\"}],\"next_st